aft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122614","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122614.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122614.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nArea monitoring HashMaps in `GodotArea2D` and `Area2D` were using the DefaultAllocator to allocate and free shape intersection reports many times per physics frame.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds static PagedAllocators to the HashMaps in `GodotArea2D` and `Area2D` to eliminate potential allocation thrashing. The PagedAllocators are shared between object instances (otherwise the total memory allocated for overlap reporting might grow to $n^2$ instead of $n$).\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122614/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}